A||||22||skitime||Great time at Carlisle II  ||||1||
Z||000000||skitime||07-01-2001||09:11 PM||||We had a great time at Carlisle II this past weekend.  The weather was hot but so were the Fieros there.  Here are a few pics from the weekend.  I will list the winners as soon as I get the entire list.  Thanks everyone at the show for making it a good turnout.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P6300015-1.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P6300013-1.JPG"> <BR>On Sunday there was a parade of all the winners. Only a few of the winning Fieros stayed for the parade.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P7010029-1.JPG">  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroLisa||07-01-2001||09:15 PM||||It was a good show was wayyyy too hot, i thought I was going to die out there, couldn't even muster up the energy to really clean my car!<P>So I guess you stayed for the awards- did Chris or I win anything that you remember? We were both in custom fastback.<P>Lisa<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>      <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||skitime||07-01-2001||09:29 PM||||Stock Fastback:<BR>    Jeff DeDay<BR>    Tom Derr<BR>    Veronica Houck <BR> <BR>Stock Notchback:<BR>    Jennifer Gilbert<BR>    Candi Tennant<BR>    Neil Kline <BR> <BR>Custom Fastback:<BR>    Bill Sessions<BR>    Chris Moore<BR>    Dave Horst<BR> <BR>Custom Notchback:<BR>    Earl Sessions<BR>    Jason Haughey<BR>    Ken Slish<BR> <BR>I believe the total car count was 24.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 07-01-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroLisa||07-01-2001||09:50 PM||||thanks! Which car was Gordon's, the purple 3800?||||reg||1
