Z||000022||skitime||07-02-2001||01:56 PM||||Hey, Jennifer thanks for the comment I was surprised myself because there were alot of neat cars. It was nice meeting Chad again.  Fleabit visited a friend and wasn't able to make it.<P>FieroGT 914 - Nice talking with you and your dad.  I talked to Fleabit and he does have the rear fastback clip, rear bumper and stuff underneath as well as taillights for a GT.||||reg||1
